 pictures, GIFs, custom emojis and audio files\nRun polls, pin messages, and react to anything\nMessage friends one-on-one\n\nTalk face to face\n\nJoin voice channels with up to 8 people\nStart 1-on-1 voice and video calls\nTurn on your camera and share your screen\n\nMake it yours\n\nPick from lots of themes, including a spooky Halloween one\nCustomize your profile with a banner, bio and status\nOrganize your spaces into folders\n\nBuilt to be safe and simple\n\nSign up with just a username and password, with no email needed\nOptional two-step login\nPictures are stripped of hidden location data before they\u2019re sent\nBlock and report tools, and moderators who keep spaces friendly\nFree to use, with no paywalls", "short_description": "Chat, voice and video with friends and communities. Free, with no email needed."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nexora-nu-eight-99.vercel.app/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Xscape", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nexora-nu-eight-99.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1321188507752605"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300738_1790992788907404_692642999457376058_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110